<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 2:</B>&nbsp;RESOLVED as an ordinary
resolution, to ratify the appointment of Assentsure PAC as the Company&rsquo;s independent registered public accounting firm for the
fiscal year ending December 31, 2023 (the &ldquo;Ratification of Appointment of Auditors Proposal&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

