<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 5:</B>&nbsp;RESOLVED as a special
resolution, to approve, upon approval of the Share Consolidation Proposal and the Share Increase Proposal, that the current memorandum
and articles of association of the Company be amended and restated to reflect the Share Consolidation and Share Increase (the &ldquo;M&amp;A
Amendment&rdquo;), and that the registered office service provider to the Company be authorized to make any and all filings necessary
by the foregoing with the Registrar of Companies of the Cayman Islands as required by applicable Cayman Islands law (the &ldquo;Filing
Proposal&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

